    "created_at": "2016-07-22T14:29:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-22T14:29:26Z",
    "body": "In Gecko CSP checks are done on any hit from this list, precisely because of this issue.  See near the end of https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1206961#c15 and https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1206961#c65 for the discussion about this when we pushed CSP checks down into something more like fetch instead of doing them before even talking to the image loader.\n",
